// Title: File Download Via Windows Defender MpCmpRun.EXE
// ID: 46123129-1024-423e-9fae-43af4a0fa9a5
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Matthew Matchen
// Date: 2020-09-04
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218, attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
// Description: Detects the use of Windows Defender MpCmdRun.EXE to download files
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "DownloadFile") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "url"))) AND ((where(OriginalFileName = "MpCmdRun.exe")) OR (where(Image IENDSWITH "\\MpCmdRun.exe")) OR (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "MpCmdRun.exe")) OR (where(Description = "Microsoft Malware Protection Command Line Utility"))))
